WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.276
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:04.546 --> 00:08.049
AM 08:12 TST TAIPEI

3
00:17.829 --> 00:23.579
"What are you prioritizing over the lives of your loved ones?

4
00:25.829 --> 00:32.912
"You are on a fool's errand... Carry out your missions immediately."

5
00:33.995 --> 00:36.704
They must know what we're up to.

6
00:36.829 --> 00:39.162
I bet they're watching us.

7
00:53.964 --> 00:56.401
I'm in the kiDnap GAME. Can we talk?

8
01:10.662 --> 01:15.048
I have two children.

9
01:15.288 --> 01:16.963
I do my best to balance

10
01:16.994 --> 01:22.276
housework and my career, for all my fellow moms out there.

11
01:22.375 --> 01:24.369
YOU LOOK TIRED.

12
01:27.949 --> 01:28.542
Hi Papa!

13
01:34.873 --> 01:35.790
Hi Papa!

14
01:41.787 --> 01:43.870
ATRA FLOWER SHOP

15
02:01.551 --> 02:02.303
Papa?

16
02:05.761 --> 02:06.536
Papa...?

17
02:08.955 --> 02:09.922
Papa?!

18
02:13.489 --> 02:17.155
That's great.

19
02:17.315 --> 02:19.730
Look down a little.

20
02:19.910 --> 02:22.296
That's it. Perfect.

21
02:22.814 --> 02:24.855
I'll be done in two hours.

22
02:27.330 --> 02:30.616
I told them it's an overnight shoot.

23
02:39.536 --> 02:40.968
I'm working.

24
02:41.776 --> 02:45.010
Papa's been... Papa's been kidnapped!

25
02:47.003 --> 02:47.769
What?

26
02:50.378 --> 02:50.870
Leona?!

27
02:56.323 --> 02:56.843
Papa...

28
03:00.990 --> 03:01.770
Leona...

29
03:03.683 --> 03:05.650
What's the kiDnap GAME?

30
03:05.932 --> 03:07.010
Why do you ask?

31
03:09.150 --> 03:10.483
Someone at school

32
03:11.150 --> 03:14.566
said Papa was kidnapped in the kiDnap GAME.

33
03:15.191 --> 03:16.050
Ignore them.

34
03:17.162 --> 03:19.302
-But... -Don't worry about it!

35
03:20.900 --> 03:23.358
TOSHI_RO I'M IN THE KIDNAP GAME. CAN WE TALK?

36
03:33.400 --> 03:35.691
LET'S MEET.

37
04:32.843 --> 04:36.066
KIDNAP GAME

38
04:38.110 --> 04:40.444
5 CONTESTANTS LEFT.

39
04:40.817 --> 04:45.192
5 DAYS AND 9 HOURS UNTIL THE GAME ENDS.

40
04:53.963 --> 04:55.380
She sent a message.

41
04:56.588 --> 04:58.297
She says "Let's meet."

42
04:58.508 --> 04:59.883
What changed?

43
05:00.922 --> 05:03.088
Maybe she replied because,

44
05:03.213 --> 05:06.547
like you, she's tasked with the impossible.

45
05:14.463 --> 05:19.130
Each mission is different, but they're all very difficult.

46
05:19.255 --> 05:22.588
Your mission is to capture the mastermind.

47
05:22.713 --> 05:24.810
Not easy, even for a detective.

48
05:25.880 --> 05:29.863
-In Manila, money. -Impossible even by illegal means.

49
05:30.463 --> 05:33.505
In Bangkok, a politician's confession.

50
05:34.172 --> 05:35.963
Equally futile.

51
05:36.880 --> 05:41.150
In Singapore... I think her mission's a chain of riddles.

52
05:41.175 --> 05:42.063
CHECKPOINT ONE CLEARED.

53
05:42.297 --> 05:45.172
It'll take a long time to solve them.

54
05:45.297 --> 05:46.588
AM 09:09 SGT SINGAPORE

55
05:53.838 --> 05:55.213
Thank you!

56
06:01.031 --> 06:06.036
Your own mission would be a piece of cake for a man who didn't value life.

57
06:06.097 --> 06:08.976
COMMIT MURDER

58
06:09.713 --> 06:14.047
But for you, it's unimaginably tough.

59
06:15.213 --> 06:18.880
You said you'd rescue all the hostages.

60
06:21.255 --> 06:24.297
But what if you could only rescue one?

61
06:31.213 --> 06:35.672
I would rescue Rian. My daughter.

62
06:40.422 --> 06:43.672
AM 11:02 JST NAHA

63
06:47.570 --> 06:48.880
HACKING COMPLETE

64
06:50.009 --> 06:52.243
You need better security.

65
06:57.516 --> 06:59.172
Have you seen him?

66
06:59.297 --> 07:02.588
-Nah, never. You? -Nope.

67
07:02.588 --> 07:02.797
TOKYO

68
07:02.797 --> 07:05.172
-Sorry, no. -I see.

69
07:07.422 --> 07:08.650
What should I do...?

70
07:14.163 --> 07:17.690
I have two children.

71
07:18.476 --> 07:23.838
I do my best to balance

72
07:24.243 --> 07:29.763
housework and my career, for all my fellow moms out there.

73
07:29.969 --> 07:32.830
-This one's the same... -What?

74
07:33.783 --> 07:38.936
She often mentions her children but never her husband.

75
07:40.116 --> 07:43.490
Could it be that they're on bad terms?

76
07:55.298 --> 07:56.756
You know the "kiDnap GAME"?

77
07:58.951 --> 08:00.517
It's a malicious rumor.

78
08:01.476 --> 08:06.583
Other hostages were murdered when the missions failed, supposedly.

79
08:07.610 --> 08:12.883
We can't make progress if the kidnapper's demands are kept secret.

80
08:16.256 --> 08:17.796
What do you mean?

81
08:18.409 --> 08:20.423
My husband is gone. Why keep secrets?

82
08:22.470 --> 08:23.236
Where to?

83
08:24.203 --> 08:25.505
To pick up my son.

84
08:28.922 --> 08:33.088
PM 12:34 TST

85
08:48.270 --> 08:49.312
Yes...?

86
08:49.363 --> 08:51.154
Can you pick up Rui?

87
08:51.529 --> 08:54.279
Again...? Why can't you go?

88
08:54.463 --> 08:56.713
I've got a lot on my plate.

89
08:57.297 --> 08:58.422
Fine.

90
09:19.114 --> 09:22.031
YOU'RE BEING FOLLOWED. RUN!

91
09:33.422 --> 09:36.042
-Oh, my gosh! I'm so sorry. -I'm OK.

92
09:36.067 --> 09:38.528
I wasn't looking. I was blind.

93
09:39.180 --> 09:42.033
Are you OK? Are you sure?

94
09:42.794 --> 09:43.835
Hey!

95
09:44.835 --> 09:46.377
Welcome.

96
09:53.919 --> 09:56.044
I'm Toshiro Niide, Tokyo.

97
09:57.210 --> 09:58.877
I'm Christina Lin.

98
10:03.383 --> 10:07.210
Thanks for your help. How did you know I was being followed?

99
10:07.533 --> 10:10.216
Experience. I'm detective.

100
10:11.835 --> 10:13.356
That makes sense.

101
10:23.970 --> 10:26.252
I’m Han Kiju from Seoul, Korea.

102
10:27.282 --> 10:28.696
I'm Christina Lin.

103
10:35.981 --> 10:40.169
-We don’t have much time, so let’s cut to the chase. -Sure.

104
10:40.835 --> 10:45.252
I was given a mission to capture the mastermind. Were you given a mission?

105
10:47.675 --> 10:48.402
Yes.

106
10:50.189 --> 10:53.630
Could you hold off completing it and work with us?

107
10:54.670 --> 10:57.316
They’ll kill my husband. I can’t abandon him.

108
10:57.842 --> 11:00.752
I’ll capture the mastermind. I just need your help.

109
11:01.116 --> 11:03.298
Are you trying to complete your own mission first?

110
11:03.323 --> 11:06.256
No! I’m trying to rescue the hostages. All of them.

111
11:07.198 --> 11:08.532
I’m asking for your help.

112
11:10.282 --> 11:14.690
At this rate, another hostage will die. More people will suffer.

113
11:19.990 --> 11:22.790
He's right. He saved my life.

114
11:26.063 --> 11:29.896
I think cooperation’s our best bet right now.

115
11:32.532 --> 11:38.073
My mission... is to commit murder.

116
11:39.282 --> 11:45.073
I believe you’re here because you also received an impossible demand.

117
11:45.698 --> 11:50.069
In which case, could you help us?

118
11:52.176 --> 11:53.490
Please.

119
12:00.407 --> 12:03.782
My mission was the same. Kill someone.

120
12:06.907 --> 12:08.532
I could never do that.

121
12:11.573 --> 12:13.157
I’ll cooperate,

122
12:13.282 --> 12:18.115
if it means saving my husband... saving everyone else!

123
12:22.532 --> 12:23.407
We will.

124
12:26.782 --> 12:30.198
Do you have any ideas on who the mastermind might be?

125
12:31.407 --> 12:32.240
No.

126
12:32.365 --> 12:33.865
No idea why you were chosen?

127
12:34.490 --> 12:36.073
I have no idea.

128
12:39.323 --> 12:42.157
I have to go, before they’ll get suspicious.

129
12:42.365 --> 12:45.365
If I think of anything, I'll let you know.

130
12:46.323 --> 12:47.198
Wait.

131
12:50.407 --> 12:52.573
Have we met before somewhere?

132
12:54.657 --> 12:55.490
No.

133
12:56.948 --> 12:59.698
Maybe it's because I'm a model.

134
13:02.032 --> 13:02.865
Maybe.

135
13:05.157 --> 13:06.782
I really have to go.

136
13:22.490 --> 13:24.490
That was an act.

137
13:24.948 --> 13:27.573
-She lied about her mission. -Yeah.

138
13:29.894 --> 13:33.143
She has her guard up.

139
13:34.115 --> 13:37.925
She might see us as rivals... or even as enemies.

140
13:38.865 --> 13:40.657
What's she planning?

141
13:41.073 --> 13:45.490
She may try to throw us off and complete her mission.

142
14:00.240 --> 14:01.782
Listen closely.

143
14:03.115 --> 14:06.198
There are two men following us.

144
14:06.782 --> 14:09.448
-Police? -I doubt it.

145
14:10.038 --> 14:11.490
The mastermind's men?

146
14:11.615 --> 14:14.198
If so, I'll make them talk.

147
14:14.523 --> 14:16.523
Keep an eye on her.

148
14:43.365 --> 14:44.948
What do you want?

149
15:05.755 --> 15:07.621
What do you want with her?

150
15:55.089 --> 15:58.883
Who are you?! Who sent you?!

151
16:13.490 --> 16:14.823
Hey!

152
16:19.407 --> 16:20.657
Damn.

153
16:33.076 --> 16:34.073
Kiju.

154
16:36.178 --> 16:38.692
-How'd it go? -They got away.

155
16:42.030 --> 16:43.032
You okay?

156
16:54.663 --> 16:55.510
Thanks.

157
16:57.247 --> 16:58.776
Who were they?

158
16:59.913 --> 17:02.913
-Mama! -Rui!

159
17:03.038 --> 17:05.913
-I missed you. -I missed you too!

160
17:07.080 --> 17:08.205
Thank you.

161
17:08.830 --> 17:10.038
Where were you?

162
17:10.580 --> 17:11.376
I was...

163
17:14.156 --> 17:16.455
What were you doing?

164
17:16.997 --> 17:20.330
-Stop keeping secrets! -Come back, Leona!

165
17:21.122 --> 17:22.372
Watch them.

166
17:26.705 --> 17:29.580
-Are you okay? -Yes, thank you.

167
17:31.122 --> 17:35.247
Make sure you're dressed so you're not cold.

168
17:35.372 --> 17:36.205
I'm okay.

169
18:07.913 --> 18:09.997
The scene of the crime.

170
18:18.080 --> 18:19.163
Papa?

171
18:32.955 --> 18:34.080
I'm sorry...

172
18:35.038 --> 18:36.372
You all right?

173
18:39.788 --> 18:43.163
Wait... wait! Are you the Tokyo man?

174
18:45.788 --> 18:49.038
You’re the policeman whose wife was kidnapped!

175
18:52.038 --> 18:54.580
-How do you... -Wait.

176
18:55.288 --> 18:56.247
Look!

177
19:00.247 --> 19:02.997
Why are you here? To meet Mom?

178
19:04.705 --> 19:07.830
Answer me! I only want to save my Papa!

179
19:08.872 --> 19:12.872
Mom’s in the game too, right? Are they telling her to do something?

180
19:13.330 --> 19:15.788
Will that save Papa? What are they telling her to do?

181
19:17.580 --> 19:19.622
Sorry. I don’t know.

182
19:22.310 --> 19:26.816
I’d like to know her mission myself. You don’t have any idea?

183
19:29.580 --> 19:32.913
Since Papa was kidnapped,

184
19:33.747 --> 19:37.372
-Mom’s been secretly calling this guy. -Guy?

185
19:37.497 --> 19:40.330
Kevin -- my piano tutor.

186
19:40.455 --> 19:43.372
She asked him about a video.

187
19:44.230 --> 19:46.650
You deleted the video, right?

188
19:47.528 --> 19:48.490
That's okay, then...

189
19:49.330 --> 19:50.580
A video?

190
19:52.016 --> 19:55.090
But, why do you need to know what her mission is?

191
19:56.336 --> 20:00.415
Are you trying to stop her? If you stop her, Papa will be killed!

192
20:00.440 --> 20:04.083
-No, no. That’s not what I’m trying to do! -No, no. Stay away from me!

193
20:07.723 --> 20:10.663
My mission was the same. Kill someone.

194
20:10.914 --> 20:12.831
That was an act.

195
20:13.205 --> 20:14.538
She lied.

196
20:14.743 --> 20:16.577
Are they telling her to do something?

197
20:17.110 --> 20:19.583
Will that save Papa? What are they telling her to do?

198
20:33.538 --> 20:38.038
EXPOSE THE SEX VIDEO WITH YOUR AFFAIR PARTNER TO THE LIGHT OF DAY

199
21:00.149 --> 21:01.065
What is it?

200
21:02.955 --> 21:04.080
What's this?

201
21:06.788 --> 21:08.872
A record of our love.

202
21:08.997 --> 21:10.538
Don't bullshit me!

203
21:10.705 --> 21:12.455
And your beauty, too.

204
21:15.538 --> 21:18.705
Delete it!

205
21:36.056 --> 21:37.747
Is this the first time?

206
21:38.622 --> 21:39.538
Of course.

207
21:41.580 --> 21:44.622
Hey.

208
21:47.913 --> 21:49.330
Trust me.

209
21:50.436 --> 21:52.955
That was the first and the last.

210
21:54.497 --> 21:58.913
From now on, I'm only recording you with these eyes.

211
22:20.538 --> 22:21.663
Hi, Kevin.

212
22:22.705 --> 22:26.330
Christina... What's the matter?

213
22:27.997 --> 22:32.080
Sorry to keep bothering you. About that video...

214
22:32.205 --> 22:35.536
That again? You saw me delete it.

215
22:36.763 --> 22:39.450
That was the only one, right?

216
22:40.176 --> 22:42.463
Of course it was. Trust me.

217
22:44.855 --> 22:45.850
I do, but...

218
22:46.389 --> 22:48.139
Something worrying you?

219
22:51.263 --> 22:52.723
Anything I can do?

220
22:55.492 --> 22:59.247
No, it's okay... Your voice makes me feel better.

221
23:00.087 --> 23:04.900
Well, if something comes up, let me know. I'd do anything for you.

222
23:06.296 --> 23:08.503
Thanks. I'll call again.

223
23:57.788 --> 24:00.455
Emergency patient, Dr. Han.

224
24:04.510 --> 24:05.830
Japanese?

225
24:07.810 --> 24:08.913
Tokyo?

226
24:12.430 --> 24:13.098
5 YEARS AGO

227
24:13.123 --> 24:14.580
A brain tumor?!

228
24:15.370 --> 24:18.770
She might not only go blind. She may even die.

229
24:19.289 --> 24:20.702
No...

230
24:21.716 --> 24:25.650
Please, you have to save her!

231
24:27.996 --> 24:33.705
Yes, of course. I'll return to Seoul at once. I'll make sure she pulls through this.

232
24:34.577 --> 24:37.243
Emergency patient, Dr. Han.

233
24:38.616 --> 24:39.616
Doctor?!

234
24:48.706 --> 24:50.914
Please! Save my child!

235
24:51.285 --> 24:52.952
Please wait your turn.

236
24:53.077 --> 24:54.452
No! He needs help!

237
24:54.827 --> 24:57.577
Look at him! He spilled hot water on himself.

238
24:57.702 --> 25:01.452
What if it leaves scars? Are you going to responsible for this?

239
25:01.577 --> 25:03.160
Others are waiting.

240
25:03.224 --> 25:06.630
Please, you have to save her!

241
25:07.077 --> 25:12.363
Save my child. Right now, please.

242
25:12.388 --> 25:14.555
-Others are waiting. -Doctor?

243
25:14.868 --> 25:16.077
I'll examine him.

244
25:16.577 --> 25:18.493
Thank you so much.

245
25:20.952 --> 25:26.618
What about the emergency patient, Dr. Han?

246
25:33.993 --> 25:35.868
What's wrong, Kiju?

247
25:38.910 --> 25:41.993
I remembered how I met her.

248
25:42.410 --> 25:43.910
Christina?

249
25:45.493 --> 25:49.285
Yes, I treated her son five years ago, in Tokyo.

250
25:50.410 --> 25:54.035
Five years ago? In Tokyo?

251
25:54.743 --> 25:57.452
My mind was on Rian.

252
25:58.202 --> 26:00.577
That's why I didn't remember.

253
26:01.118 --> 26:04.577
Anything else you remember? Just her son?

254
26:05.993 --> 26:07.868
My memory's hazy.

255
26:10.452 --> 26:13.868
Give me some time. I'll look it up.

256
26:14.993 --> 26:16.785
All right. Thanks.

257
26:23.202 --> 26:24.910
Five years ago...

258
26:26.827 --> 26:29.660
Put your anger aside. Show me your kindness...

259
26:30.035 --> 26:33.243
Kindness that shields the weak...

260
26:33.910 --> 26:39.156
That's the right thing for you to do.

261
27:00.243 --> 27:01.368
What's wrong?

262
27:04.202 --> 27:07.535
He's outside. The kiDnap GAME participant.

263
27:09.243 --> 27:11.910
He asked me about you.

264
27:13.535 --> 27:18.618
What's your mission, Mom? What do you have to do to get Papa back?

265
27:21.835 --> 27:23.294
Answer me!

266
27:23.788 --> 27:27.371
Is Kevin involved somehow? What's the video?

267
27:31.743 --> 27:32.910
He's not...

268
27:33.035 --> 27:35.785
I already know everything, okay?!

269
27:40.769 --> 27:42.676
Why do you think I quit piano?

270
27:44.010 --> 27:49.397
So you wouldn't see Kevin anymore!

271
27:51.083 --> 27:53.636
He's not the man you think he is.

272
27:54.070 --> 27:56.303
He took a pass at me, too.

273
28:04.993 --> 28:10.830
That can't be true...

274
28:10.888 --> 28:12.828
You only ever think about yourself.

275
28:14.603 --> 28:18.743
No, I don't. I've always done my best.

276
28:19.283 --> 28:22.256
For our family. To be a good mother.

277
28:22.320 --> 28:24.616
All for yourself!

278
28:31.543 --> 28:34.118
I only ever wanted you to be a mom.

279
28:34.635 --> 28:37.343
Not a model or an "ageless beauty."

280
28:37.368 --> 28:39.993
A proper mom. That's all I wanted.

281
28:42.556 --> 28:47.577
I'll never forgive you if you abandon Papa.

282
29:02.035 --> 29:07.577
Five years ago...? Yes, I more or less remember.

283
29:09.969 --> 29:11.636
Any problems?

284
29:11.961 --> 29:14.711
Nothing I can recall...

285
29:16.489 --> 29:18.303
Could you look them up?

286
29:38.069 --> 29:41.823
PM 06:51 TST

287
29:49.986 --> 29:51.377
Sorry about this morning.

288
29:53.450 --> 29:56.952
It’s fine. I know how you feel. Thanks.

289
30:24.827 --> 30:25.796
Come in.

290
30:42.285 --> 30:43.618
Good to see you.

291
30:56.016 --> 30:57.235
I missed you.

292
31:02.149 --> 31:07.169
Emergencies... 2021...

293
31:08.952 --> 31:09.785
This is it.

294
31:19.807 --> 31:20.856
You've suffered.

295
31:22.517 --> 31:23.816
Help me forget.

296
31:52.635 --> 31:54.052
Any information?

297
31:54.177 --> 31:59.027
I'm sending you the examination records from that day.

298
31:59.052 --> 32:00.260
Thanks.

299
32:00.324 --> 32:03.383
TOKYO GENERAL MEDICAL CENTER RUI LIN

300
32:16.023 --> 32:17.035
Gonna go shower.

301
33:22.118 --> 33:24.057
Why were you trying to find me?

302
33:56.256 --> 33:59.049
Pretty good, huh?

303
34:00.283 --> 34:03.491
Remember when she took Rui to Japan?

304
34:04.401 --> 34:06.026
I went too.

305
34:09.443 --> 34:13.568
We're still together, even now.

306
34:16.346 --> 34:19.223
Man, that body of hers...

307
34:19.491 --> 34:22.643
Easy there, you're on video.

308
34:28.616 --> 34:32.734
Think, who has the most to lose if the truth gets out?

309
34:48.470 --> 34:49.089
How's this?

310
34:51.512 --> 34:53.303
Buy this video from me.

311
34:53.678 --> 34:58.637
You don't want to destroy everything your trophy wife worked for.

312
35:59.262 --> 36:00.095
You okay?

313
36:01.345 --> 36:02.512
Yeah.

314
36:09.220 --> 36:11.553
-Why don't we... -I have to go.

315
36:23.887 --> 36:25.262
NEW MESSAGE

316
36:26.637 --> 36:27.762
Who's that?

317
36:28.928 --> 36:31.428
NIIDE'S FRIEND? I'LL SEE YOU SOON.

318
36:32.137 --> 36:33.678
What on earth...?

319
36:38.678 --> 36:41.012
WHO ARE YOU?

320
36:52.387 --> 36:54.053
Isn't that...?

321
36:54.887 --> 36:56.762
It's him! Oh man!

322
36:57.553 --> 37:00.512
-The reward money! -I want the reward!

323
37:11.220 --> 37:13.595
100,000 YEN REWARD FOR FINDING HIM.

324
37:14.027 --> 37:15.470
I see.

325
37:20.656 --> 37:21.783
There he is!

326
37:24.109 --> 37:27.582
Wow! I just might be a genius.

327
37:43.387 --> 37:45.553
Where did you go?

328
37:45.678 --> 37:47.553
It’s none of your business.

329
37:48.220 --> 37:49.803
Wait... wait!

330
37:56.762 --> 37:59.345
She asked him about a video.

331
38:12.137 --> 38:12.970
Follow her!

332
38:31.053 --> 38:34.095
THE GAME WILL END IF A PLAYER COMPLETES THE ASSIGNED MISSION.

333
39:07.887 --> 39:10.262
ONLY ONE SHALL PREVAIL...

334
39:27.200 --> 39:30.916
Open the door! Open the door!

335
39:58.336 --> 40:01.670
EXPOSE THE SEX VIDEO WITH YOUR AFFAIR PARTNER TO THE LIGHT OF DAY

336
40:06.678 --> 40:09.220
CONFIRM UPLOAD?

337
40:11.763 --> 40:14.928
Open up! I know you're in there!

338
40:16.699 --> 40:18.365
Open the door!

339
40:24.262 --> 40:26.887
Not a model or an "ageless beauty."

340
40:27.012 --> 40:29.220
A proper mom. That's all I wanted.

341
40:37.053 --> 40:40.637
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

342
40:52.416 --> 40:56.203
-Hey, where did he go? -That way, I guess?

343
41:00.563 --> 41:01.396
Found you.

344
41:06.938 --> 41:08.980
Give it up!

345
41:19.480 --> 41:20.373
Open!

346
41:23.333 --> 41:24.166
What?

347
41:32.313 --> 41:34.521
-Wait... wait! -No stop!

348
41:38.146 --> 41:41.605
-I’m sorry. -Wait! Give us some time!

349
41:42.771 --> 41:45.271
Let me be a good mother, just this once!

350
41:45.688 --> 41:47.105
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

351
41:47.480 --> 41:51.146
If the game ends now, they’ll kill the other hostages!

352
41:54.396 --> 41:55.646
Wait.

353
41:58.111 --> 42:00.423
-Please, let her! -Get off!

354
42:00.448 --> 42:02.865
Let Mom save Papa! Please!

355
42:04.063 --> 42:06.438
Don't try to stop her!

356
42:07.896 --> 42:10.089
Out of the way! Let go!

357
42:10.849 --> 42:13.182
-Hey! -Don't do this to us!

358
42:14.938 --> 42:19.216
UPLOAD IN PROGRESS

359
42:35.230 --> 42:37.813
UPLOAD CANCELED

360
42:38.646 --> 42:41.355
Why?

361
42:51.445 --> 43:02.810
Why? Why?!

362
43:03.033 --> 43:05.242
THE FILES HAVE BEEN DELETED.

363
43:12.646 --> 43:14.688
Made it...

364
43:19.521 --> 43:22.605
I can't afford this game to end yet.

365
43:24.688 --> 43:27.771
RYOHEI HYODO

366
43:35.980 --> 43:37.646
Why won't you answer?

367
43:56.771 --> 44:00.643
Please... Save Papa, I beg you...

368
44:01.980 --> 44:11.855
Please... Save Papa!

369
44:18.855 --> 44:21.313
Please... Save Papa!

370
44:45.396 --> 44:47.646
Calm down. Calm down.

371
44:48.355 --> 44:50.730
Let me see that, please.

372
45:06.438 --> 45:07.563
I'm sorry.

373
45:11.730 --> 45:14.271
Please... please.

374
45:14.522 --> 45:15.863
There is nothing I can do.

375
45:37.188 --> 45:46.696
Murderer! Give me back my Papa!

376
45:48.447 --> 45:52.616
Give me back my Papa!

377
46:05.146 --> 46:08.563
AM 05:50 TST

378
46:25.483 --> 46:26.370
You okay?

379
46:28.337 --> 46:32.649
Managed to shake off the police somehow. And you?

380
46:33.993 --> 46:35.666
The men got away.

381
46:38.087 --> 46:39.670
What happened?

382
46:41.059 --> 46:43.420
The video was suddenly deleted.

383
46:44.337 --> 46:48.837
-How? -Dunno... Someone might have interfered...

384
46:52.420 --> 46:54.754
To stop her from completing her mission?

385
46:54.879 --> 46:57.045
That's all I can think of...

386
46:58.545 --> 47:04.212
Completing the mission and interfering both kill people. What are we supposed to do?

387
47:04.504 --> 47:06.462
They're enjoying this.

388
47:14.629 --> 47:18.795
Did you find anything out?

389
47:19.927 --> 47:23.976
Nothing of note in the patient records.

390
47:25.045 --> 47:26.337
I see.

391
47:28.837 --> 47:32.712
There's one more thing I want to ask you...

392
47:37.420 --> 47:42.212
There's someone at reception to see you.

393
47:42.337 --> 47:43.504
Who?

394
47:43.837 --> 47:45.920
A young man.

395
47:46.045 --> 47:49.920
But something seems off about him...

396
47:51.212 --> 47:55.295
-Tell security not to let him escape. -Okay.

397
48:15.410 --> 48:16.837
We meet at last.

398
48:19.490 --> 48:22.087
So you're the famous Akina Isobe.

399
48:23.269 --> 48:28.629
Niide's friend... or Saori's?

400
48:29.212 --> 48:30.379
You...

401
48:31.295 --> 48:33.212
Are you a hothead too?

402
48:35.420 --> 48:36.962
Why are you here?

403
48:39.420 --> 48:41.379
I've brought you a scoop.

404
48:44.707 --> 48:46.062
What do you want to know?

405
48:47.210 --> 48:49.710
About the link between us.

406
48:50.310 --> 48:51.754
It could be a clue.

407
49:00.754 --> 49:06.816
"Since you continue to act like a fool, I have prepared a new stage for you."

408
49:10.584 --> 49:12.418
"A new stage"?
